<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - April 24.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - April 24.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    16.09     2.16</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	12.82     1.95</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 9.90     0.99</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.74     0.77</p>
<p> 5   Prop Income Inv	 9.26     1.09</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.12     1.79</p>
<p> 7   Villa World	     8.77     1.14</p>
<p> 8   Natl Consol	     8.74     1.03</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   8.66     0.98</p>
<p>10   Hills Inds		8.64     1.98</p>
<p>11   Natl In Prop	    8.51     1.03</p>
<p>12   Gandel Retail Tr	8.49     0.92</p>
<p>13   Equitilink		8.47     0.59</p>
<p>14   Ipoh			8.41     2.14</p>
